    "longDescription": "It is a must-have QR Scanner for all Android devices. It is very easy to use, no need to press any buttons or adjust the zoom ratio, just turn it on and point to the QR code, it will automatically recognize and scan the QR code.\n\nQR Scanner features:\nScan QR codes – Reads all common QR code formats. Works with URLs, text, contacts, Wi‑Fi, and more.\n\nCreate QR codes – Enter your own text, link, or data and generate a QR code instantly. Save or share it as needed.\n\nHistory log – Automatically keeps a record of every QR code you scan or create. You can go back and review any past item at any time.\n\nBarcode support – Scans product barcodes to show item details. If the barcode is damaged, you can also type in the numbers manually.\n\nID / Passport scan – Reads machine‑readable zones on identity documents and passports, extracting key information to save you from typing it by hand.\n\nQR Scanner is a real must-have QR code scanner for any Android mobile device.",
